 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Retry-After above the local retry threshold\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 8  \u00b7  **Symptom:** Many timers and workflow tasks per workflow.  \u00b7  **Cause:** Backoffs or Retry-After above the local retry threshold (Java default: 3 x workflow task timeout = 30 s).  \u00b7  **Fix:** Keep backoffs under the threshold; hand long waits to a regular activity.\n\n**What to watch:** Timers and workflow tasks per workflow from sampled histories.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | broken | 429 Retry-After 40 s honoured by the local activity | 120 s | 40 s > the 30 s threshold: the SDK records the attempt and starts a durable timer, then a new workflow task. |\n| 2 | baseline | recover | 45 s |  |\n| 3 | fixed | long waits handed to a regular activity | 120 s | Retry-After > 1 s fails the local activity fast; the step is retried by a regular activity, server-side. |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "demo_scenario_variant{scenario=\"long-backoff\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#8E8E8E",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "idle",
         "color": "#8E8E8E",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "baseline",
         "color": "#3274D9",
         "index": 1
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "broken",
         "color": "#E02F44",
         "index": 2
        },
        "3": {
         "text": "fixed",
         "color": "#56A64B",
         "index": 3
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "custom": {
      "fillOpacity": 80,
      "lineWidth": 0
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showValue": "auto",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.8,
    "alignValue": "left",
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   },
   "id": 2,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 7,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Per sampled workflow (from history)",
   "description": "The runner fetches the history of a sample of completed workflows and counts events. A heartbeat is a WorkflowTaskCompleted followed directly by WorkflowTaskScheduled.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_events_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\",kind=\"timer\"}[1m])) / sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_sampled_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\"}[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "timers \u00b7 {{policy}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_events_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\",kind=\"wft_completed\"}[1m])) / sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_sampled_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\"}[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "workflow tasks \u00b7 {{policy}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B"
    },
    {
     "expr": "sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_events_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\",kind=\"activity_scheduled\"}[1m])) / sum by (policy) (rate(demo_history_sampled_total{policy=~\"backoff_.*\"}[1m]))",
     "legendFormat": "regular activities \u00b7 {{policy}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "C"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 8,
      "showPoints": "never",
      "spanNulls": true,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "none",
       "group": "A"
      },
      "axisSoftMin": 0,
      "lineInterpolation": "linear"
     },
     "color": {
      "mode": "palette-classic"
     },
     "decimals": 2
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom",
     "showLegend": true
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   },
   "id": 3,
   "gridPos": {
