  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Java's local retry threshold defaults to 3 \u00d7 the workflow task timeout (30 s here)** and is set per call with `LocalActivityOptions.setLocalRetryThreshold`. A backoff (or `Retry-After`) up to that is retried in process, holding the workflow task open (heartbeating every 8 s); a longer one is recorded in a marker and a durable timer is started, which brings back a workflow task per retry. The lab's API answers with `Retry-After: 40 s` to cross it."
   },
   "id": 7,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 16,
    "y": 19,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 8
   }
  }
